	)
	(text "-V floats whenever pack A is off (OFF, under-voltage), +V whenever pack B is or the plug is out:"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 403.86 373.38 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "6c8e1319-b63b-57a2-acd3-aa994aa1b749")
	)
	(text "which conducts while the toggle is ON (its gate is Q20_G, pack A / 2 below 0V); U2B pulls Q11's gate low below 12.0 V (R11 470k: back on at 12.9 V).  So both rails need"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 17.78 276.86 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "712e7d6d-6e48-5551-a0b4-aa93725129ee")
	)
	(text "OUT: +V / 0V / -V / CAB  (JST-PH 4, to the module)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 406.4 297.18 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "7630da58-b44a-5ddb-9498-0b5673685211")
	)
	(text "D4 >= 15.9 V (80 %), D3 >= 15.1 V (50 %), D2 >= 14.3 V (20 %) from +G; D1 (ON) lit by Q14 while Q11 conducts (-V live)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 17.78 378.46 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "898b5ee8-22d8-59be-b9c2-3321a97977f1")
	)
	(text "Thresholds 15.9 / 15.1 / 14.3 V (pack) for the 80 / 50 / 20 % LEDs, cutoff 11.9 V, re-enable 12.7 V (pack B, R53 from +OUT) / 12.8 V (pack A, R11 from Q11's gate)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 261.62 226.06 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "9316d26b-a033-59a5-b754-c18f8860be5c")
	)
	(text "and its source, J3.4 (CAB), is at 0V, i.e. the strap at the module end ties pin 4 to pin 2: then R1 / R2 give Q1 Vgs = -Vsw/2 and +V is live.  ENB_G = EN_B through R81 1M, pulled to 0V by"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 17.78 266.7 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "9de6e6bc-7fdb-56e6-8f90-636351493d46")
	)
	(text "C1 / C2 at pin 8 of U1 / U2.  Bars read the open-circuit voltage (the module draws ~10 mA)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 17.78 383.54 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
